# Next.js (App Router)

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using APIs. Heed deprecations.

- Default to Server Components
- Add `'use client'` only for event listeners, browser APIs, state, or client-only libs
- Fetch and cache with the current App Router APIs (not Pages Router)
- Drive server state with URL search params when it fits the UI
- Export `metadata` / `generateMetadata` — do not use `next/head`
- Use `next/image`, `next/link`, and `next/script`
- Provide `loading.tsx` / loading UI and `error.tsx` error boundaries
- Prefer streaming and proper cache tags/revalidation over ad-hoc client fetches

```tsx
// ✅ Server Component (no 'use client')
import Link from 'next/link'
import Image from 'next/image'

export default function Page () {
	return (
		<Link href="/about">
			<Image src="/hero.png" alt="Hero" width={800} height={400} />
		</Link>
	)
}
```
